  timelineText: "Third trimester, close to the due date"
  bannerSeconds: 6
  weekContext: Week 37, third trimester
  obstacleText: "Broken sleep, heartburn and breathlessness"
  mainTaskText: "Packing the hospital bag and getting the house ready"
  contentWarningText: This game explores the emotional and physical strain of pregnancy
    and early parenthood. You can exit at any time.
  showMeterIntro: 1
  meterIntroNote: "Move with the arrow keys or WASD, and press E to use things. While packing the hospital bag, hold E and respond to the prompts: hold SPACE to catch her breath, tap Q to walk slowly, and tap F to notice the baby's kicks."
